#align(center)[
  #text(size: 14pt, weight: "bold")[Thermal characterization of suspended fine wires across continuum to free-molecular gas regimes using the 3$omega$ method]

  Chuyue Peng, Joshua Ginzburg, Uri Dickman, Jacob Bair, and Matthias Kuehne

